data_driven_RSA/python/create_searchlight_vectors: this is where we go from the RSM from the previous paper to the vectors for K-means

data_driven_RSA/python/run_kmeans_and_get_silhouettes: this is where we run K-means and get silhouette scores

data_driven_RSA/python/create_cluster_average_3by3: this is where we average over searchlights in each cluster for visualization later

data_driven_RSA/python/visualize_for_paper: this is where we visualize the clusters in the violin plots and look at silhouette scores + brain maps.
